Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Energy gets wasted for a boring reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:06.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nobody trusts the forecast enough to act on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:10.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,In September I built Agentic Arbiter, an agent for data-centre cooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:15.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Data centres run chillers even when the air outside is already cold enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:20.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,So it decides, hour by hour, when switching them off is actually safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:24.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it made no unsafe calls, where the old controller made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:28.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is four hundred extra free-cooling hours a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:29.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it grades itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:34.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it missed its target, because the data was patchy, and says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Second of eight hundred and forty-two teams, out of nearly four thousand people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:41.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,at FortyGuard's hackathon, sponsored by NVIDIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,The UN-backed Cool Coalition featured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:46.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next I want it running on real sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:48.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then I looked at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.85,0:00:53.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pakistan has solar on millions of roofs, but the grid cannot see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:55.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,I asked twenty-one families.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:01:00.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Seven of the ten with solar have changed habits or are getting a battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:06.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I am building a Solar Home Agent, for homes that cannot sell their spare power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:12.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Go over two hundred units in a month, and every single unit costs more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,That keeps this home under the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:19.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Five thousand rupees this month, and nineteen thousand over the next six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:24.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thirteen of them said they would only trust an app that explains itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:29.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,So when it is not sure, it says no, and tells you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:34.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,It still wastes most of its midday sun. Storage is what closes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:38.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is a simulation, on one real month of Islamabad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:43.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next, five to ten homes in Islamabad, with the agent messaging them on WhatsApp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.63,0:01:48.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,An Energy and AI circle at COMSATS, and I would join IRENA NewGen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:51.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then one neighbourhood forecast, built with IESCO.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.33,0:01:53.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,The solar is already on Pakistan's roofs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:57.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want the grid to see it, and trust it.
